+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Story 2.4: a real wallet's own anchor session. `runAnchorSep10` above
+// requires a `Keypair` this backend can sign with, which is only ever true
+// for a managed account (a design question Story 2.1 explicitly left open
