+/**
+ * Fetches the anchor's SEP-10 challenge for `params.account` and confirms it
+ * actually came from the anchor and actually names that account -- the same
+ * two checks {@link runAnchorSep10} makes before ever signing anything --
+ * but returns the challenge unsigned instead of signing it, since this
+ * backend holds no key for a real wallet. Throws {@link AnchorAuthError} for
+ * anything that fails either check, or for a challenge naming a different
+ * account (mirrors the exact account-identity check Story 2.1's review found
+ * missing on the sign-and-submit side).
